ork are fixed and closed. The [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]lander triages what is left and proposes the next five-bead epic [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]under the same rules, and the chain continues until no open task [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]beads remain.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]task_bead_burndown_1.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/task_bead_burndown_1.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-r7[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-r7/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Whitespace-insensitive WISPr dossier kicker assertion[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]wispr-kicker[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wispr-kicker: make the wispr_summary lib test check the letter-spaced [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]MEETING NOTES kicker without depending on pdftotext's spacing, then [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]close bob-cli-q9.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stale ignored mount index is not an authored landing page[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs-mount-index[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wispr-kicker[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs-mount-index: stop bob-docs calling an untracked, gitignored mount [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]index.md a committed landing page, add a tools/docs test, then close [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli-it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stable frees-marks 25 ms CPU budget measurement[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bo